              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba uNkulunkulu walithanda izwe kangaka, waze wanikela ngeNdodana yakhe ezelwe yodwa, ukuba yilowo nalowo okholwa yiyo angabhubhi, kodwa abe nokuphila okuphakade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
