              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakhu ukulahlwa, ukuthi ukukhanya kufikile ezweni, kepha abantu bathanda ubumnyama kunokukhanya, ngokuba imisebenzi yabo yayimibi.",
          "type": "text",
